Code example omitted.

00:16:14.593 --> 00:16:16.803
Exports carry Content Credentials by

00:16:16.849 --> 00:16:19.188
default, signed on-device - for the

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.986
formats that can hold a manifest «PNG,

00:16:22.044 --> 00:16:25.446
JPEG, WebP, AVIF, GIF, APNG, TIFF, SVG,

00:16:25.505 --> 00:16:30.056
PDF, MP4, WebM, MP3, M4A, WAV, OGG, Opus,

00:16:30.114 --> 00:16:34.703
FLAC, HTML, CSS, JS, MD»; EPS, EMF, DXF,

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:38.877
PPTX, PSD, EXR, HDR, ICO, DOCX, ZIP and

00:16:38.907 --> 00:16:41.354
the plain-text formats have no container

00:16:41.437 --> 00:16:42.828
for one, and

00:16:43.775 --> 00:16:47.293
on-device utilities never stamp.

00:16:48.066 --> 00:16:51.553
To sign as you - so a recipient who pins

00:16:51.616 --> 00:16:54.404
your root reads Verified with your address

00:16:54.495 --> 00:16:57.232
on it rather than an anonymous signer -

00:16:57.293 --> 00:17:00.161
point it at your own key and certificate

00:17:00.221 --> 00:17:01.320
chain:

