Full command surface in docs/cli-md; the

00:17:09.478 --> 00:17:12.174
setup path from a clean machine to a

00:17:12.235 --> 00:17:15.147
working, trusted signing identity is

00:17:15.227 --> 00:17:17.844
docs/cli-signing-md.

