00:19:49.311 --> 00:19:51.772
Licensing & structure

00:19:52.859 --> 00:19:55.645
This is one repository «see Repository

00:19:55.705 --> 00:19:58.648
layout», with one private submodule for

00:19:58.708 --> 00:20:00.770
the SUSE brand pack.

00:20:01.529 --> 00:20:06.044
Code - engine/, shells/, services/, docs/

00:20:06.078 --> 00:20:08.894
- is MPL-2 point 0.

00:20:09.668 --> 00:20:13.168
Tool content ships as brand packs.

00:20:13.929 --> 00:20:17.698
community/ holds the brand-agnostic tools;

00:20:17.763 --> 00:20:20.770
brands/suse/ «private submodule

00:20:20.911 --> 00:20:23.474
suse-lolly» holds the SUSE tools and

00:20:23.539 --> 00:20:26.229
catalog - including its licensed

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:29.215
PremiumBeat music, which stays private

00:20:29.271 --> 00:20:30.745
with the pack.

00:20:31.549 --> 00:20:34.568
See each pack's NOTICE-md.

00:20:35.358 --> 00:20:37.894
Fonts ship inside each brand pack under

00:20:37.942 --> 00:20:41.857
the SIL Open Font License 1 point 1 - the

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:45.100
SUSE pack carries the SUSE and SUSE Mono

00:20:45.162 --> 00:20:47.868
typefaces «neither the MPL nor

00:20:47.961 --> 00:20:51.400
SUSE-proprietary; "SUSE" is a SUSE

00:20:51.462 --> 00:20:52.819
trademark».

00:20:53.589 --> 00:20:58.194
They appear at catalog/fonts/ in a build.

00:20:58.973 --> 00:21:01.702
Bundled third-party attributions are

00:21:01.765 --> 00:21:05.193
listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES-md.
